        "ID_CHAMBERS_RESOURCE_GEN_FEED_HINT": {
          "Note": "Requirements: Food queue empty AND there's no feeding reward to claim, this text shows permanently below the \"Feeding Rewards\" section title. It acts as an instruction/hint for the players and what they need to do as a first step to gain the extra rewards from Scrappy. https://www.figma.com/design/5vVtDGuILlSSE3M79f2fVn/Workshop--Stations---Crafting-?node-id=6392-4058&t=bz2J2dW8RDb51YYB-1 ",
          "Status": "approved"
        },
        "ID_CHAMBERS_RESOURCE_GEN_ROUND_HINT": {
          "Note": "Requirement: Food in queue AND no feeding reward to claim AND player has not met the round/time requirement for the next feeding reward.  This text then shows permanently below the \"Feeding Rewards\" section title. This replaces the \"empty\" reward tile with on-hover tooltip text (ID_CHAMBERS_RESOURCE_GEN_FEED_TOOLTIP_ANOTHER_ROUND).   The text generalizes the previous \"a round\" to \"rounds\", and \"this reward\" to \"rewards\", respectively, as we do not specifiy the exact time requirement here (6 mins), and we do not teaser a \"specific\" reward with an empty tile. It acts as an instruction/hint on what players have to do as a next step to gain extra rewards from Scrappy. https://www.figma.com/design/5vVtDGuILlSSE3M79f2fVn/Workshop--Stations---Crafting-?node-id=6393-4429&t=bz2J2dW8RDb51YYB-1 ",
          "Status": "approved"
        },
        "ID_CHAMBERS_REARRANGE": {
          "Note": "Shown in the footer button legend for console/keyboard. This functionality allows players to manually and permanently rearrange the order of their unlocked workshop crafting stations in their individually desired order. This is crucial when players go on an expedition and reset their progress, and then unlock their workshop stations in a different order than before. https://www.figma.com/design/5vVtDGuILlSSE3M79f2fVn/Workshop--Stations---Crafting-?node-id=6320-42154&t=b7KeXYKLluFSAc6C-1 ",
          "Status": "approved"
        },
